<p>Israel&#x27;s military said the brother of Ayman Mohamad Ghazali, the man accused of attacking a synagogue in suburban Detroit, was a Hezbollah commander killed in an Israeli airstrike in Lebanon on March 5. The claim adds an international dimension to the FBI investigation into the March 12 attack at Temple Israel in West Bloomfield, Michigan, where authorities say Ghazali drove a vehicle into the synagogue before armed security shot and killed him. The FBI&#x27;s Detroit office declined to comment on Israel&#x27;s allegation, so American investigators have not publicly verified it.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/eXgbOp5iOJupijfZleMDeUJ9uXmm8-y7OhnuNDoQcCjVceBZETxCp7v4-xXriUJyqwYbjDIALKb0S1te4nZOU6JWfKWMoMDVeJGt9YwGTCx3IZMGiv-p37ww2c4SCwAIGghEu0rXi_PX9OzXpcGNeJxDK261w82yHVIAnCtTufYd1UIQw9rWxwhEwP5S2M0toYnduopoLSUbrdmFz3XkkFQ-81wi3D7yuELd47slgemwN1Dg9Z2VT8vjHii3_uAjNrrYd1ymZYXt8nZjhw' alt='Police tape hangs outside the Temple Israel synagogue Friday, March 13, 2026, in West Bloomfield Township, Mich.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Attack method: U.S. officials previously said the synagogue vehicle was a truck carrying explosives, adding detail beyond the alleged ramming itself.</li><li>Strike toll: Reports said the March 5 Israeli airstrike killed four of Ayman Ghazali&#x27;s relatives, including his brother Ibrahim.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israel Defense Forces: The IDF said Ibrahim Muhammad Ghazali managed weapons operations for Hezbollah. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/israel-defense-forces-ayman-mohamad-ghazali-brother-michigan-synagogue-suspect-hezbollah-commander/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>FBI Detroit office: The bureau declined to comment on the Israeli military&#x27;s allegation about the attacker&#x27;s brother as it continued investigating the synagogue attack. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israeli-military-claims-brother-of-man-who-attacked-michigan-synagogue-was-hezbollah-commander/article70747623.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>U.S. investigators: Before Israel publicly identified the brother, American officials said only that the attacker had recently lost family in Lebanon, without naming the relatives or describing any affiliations. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4gj1135x7ro'>BBC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/israel-defense-forces-ayman-mohamad-ghazali-brother-michigan-synagogue-suspect-hezbollah-commander/'>IDF says Michigan synagogue suspect&#x27;s brother was Hezbollah commander</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3346686/brother-michigan-synagogue-attacker-was-hezbollah-commander-israeli-military-claims'>Brother of Michigan synagogue attacker was Hezbollah commander, Israeli military claims</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/15/world/middleeast/israel-lebanon-michigan-synagogue-hezbollah.html'>Israel Says Michigan Synagogue Attacker’s Brother Was a Hezbollah Commander</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-michigan-synagogue-hezbollah-israel/'>Israeli military says Michigan synagogue attacker’s brother was Hezbollah commander</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4gj1135x7ro'>Michigan synagogue attacker&#x27;s brother was Hezbollah commander, IDF says</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israeli-military-claims-brother-of-man-who-attacked-michigan-synagogue-was-hezbollah-commander/article70747623.ece'>Israeli military claims brother of man who attacked Michigan synagogue was Hezbollah commander</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>